{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o023c","title":"日食曹丕禁止以灾异劾三公","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o023c-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"日食曹丕禁止以灾异劾三公","evidence":["wendi-e-o023c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"颁诏","evidence":["wendi-e-o023c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"黄初二年六月戊辰晦","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o019","basis":"黄初二年六月戊辰晦"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o023c-q","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o023c-q","source_order":[2,232,"O023c"],"order":581}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o023c-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-b6c7fa1367a90722fd81","layer":"original","quote":"戊辰晦〖25〗，日有食之；有司奏免太尉〖26〗，诏曰：“灾异之作，以谴元首〖27〗；而归过股肱〖28〗，岂禹、汤罪己之义乎〖29〗？其令百官，各虔厥职。后有天地之眚〖30〗，勿复劾三公。”","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":231,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":46,"end":140},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
